EmbeddingGemma (Google)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The app's optional natural-language search feature downloads Google's
EmbeddingGemma model at the user's request and runs it on-device to convert
search queries into vectors. The model file is distributed unmodified — the
lmstudio-community Q4_0 QAT GGUF build (embeddinggemma-300m-qat-Q4_0.gguf,
229,093,184 bytes, SHA-256
5a9e0645541b06367dec3fd14d0019015b872cfe36d35dfb2a9d752dade09020). The model
weights are never committed to this repository and are not covered by this
repository's license.

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms.

Use of the model is additionally subject to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy at
ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llama.cpp
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The same feature embeds llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp) to
run the model.

